OL,3,ABuddhist monk arrested in suspected $3m
OL,4,Aembezzlement scandal
OL,5,
OL,6,FThai police have arrested a Buddhist
OL,7,Fmonk on suspicion of embezzling 100
OL,8,Fmillion baht ($3m; #2.2m) from his
OL,9,Fmonastery, along with a suspected
OL,10,Ffemale accomplice he was filmed having
OL,11,Fsex with.
OL,13,FPhra Wachirayan Wi, a former abbot at
OL,14,Fthe prominent 14th-Century Wat
OL,15,FPhutthaisawan in the ancient capital of
OL,16,FAyutthaya, allegedly pocketed donations
OL,17,Fmeant for the temple on more than 20
OL,18,Foccasions over two years.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
